; INVALID: a depth format cannot be a mip chain's color target.
;
; The generated passes render color into each level and sample the previous
; one through a filterable view; a depth aspect is a different attachment and
; a different sampling rule (deferred by the plan, not folded into this hook).

(texture :name mipTex :size [64 64] :format depth24plus
  :mip-level-count 4 :usage [texture-binding render-attachment])
(mip-chain :name fillMips :texture mipTex)
